          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It depends on your competition, your starting point, and the scope of work — so we scope every engagement after a free audit rather than quoting a one-size-fits-all price. Most engagements are monthly retainers sized to your competition and goals; transparent pricing, no hidden fees, no lock-in."
          }
        },
